      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹19.17 (vs ₹14.94 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹19.17 (up from ₹14.94 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹1.43b (down 3.5% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹339.6m (up 28% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 24% (up from 18% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 17% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 23% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
